## Serialize the fork

From the monorepo root:

```sh
git diff code-oss-upstream-8a7abeba..HEAD -- apps/review-desktop/code-oss
```

For an upstream refresh, clone the recorded commit into a fresh temporary
directory, apply the same vendor-time exclusions, and compare it recursively
with `code-oss/`. The only remaining differences must be the paths enumerated
above. Update this file whenever that inventory changes.
